{
  "id": "prologue",
  "title": "序幕 山路晨雾",
  "nextSceneId": "chapter-01",
  "initialState": {
    "background": "assets/bg/01.png",
    "bgm": "assets/audio/bgm/prologue.mp3",
    "flags": {
      "trustedUmi": false
    }
  },
  "events": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "id": "forestMorning",
      "background": "assets/bg/01.png"
    },
    {
      "type": "showCharacter",
      "characterId": "umi",
      "sprite": "default",
      "position": "center",
      "transition": "fade"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "umi",
      "text": "你终于来了。山路的雾刚散开，我还以为你会像昨天一样迷路。",
      "voice": "assets/audio/我等了很久.mp3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "umi",
      "text": "这一幕结束后，程序会自动切到下一幕。下一幕可以换背景、换立绘、换台词，不需要改引擎代码。",
      "voice": "/assets/audio/umi/prologue-002.ogg"
    },
    {
      "type": "showCharacter",
      "characterId": "rin",
      "sprite": "default",
      "position": "left",
      "transition": "slide"
    },
    {
      "type": "bgm",
      "track": "assets/audio/bgm/prologue-soft.mp3"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "rin",
      "text": "先回答她的问题。这样你以后扩写分支、切章节、接语音的时候，结构都会保持稳定。",
      "voice": "/assets/audio/rin/prologue-001.ogg"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "firstChoice",
      "prompt": "你决定怎么回应海已？",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "说自己是特地来见她的",
          "jumpTo": "trustPath",
          "setFlag": {
            "key": "trustedUmi",
            "value": true
          }
        },
        {
          "label": "解释只是路过这里",
          "jumpTo": "neutralPath"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "id": "trustPath",
      "speaker": "umi",
      "text": "这样啊……那我就把接下来的秘密告诉你。这个 flag 会带到下一幕继续使用。",
      "voice": "/assets/audio/umi/prologue-003.ogg"
    },
    {
      "type": "jump",
      "target": "branchCheck"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "id": "neutralPath",
      "speaker": "umi",
      "text": "只是路过也没关系。故事还是会往前走，只是我暂时不会把全部心思交给你。",
      "voice": "/assets/audio/umi/prologue-004.ogg"
    },
    {
      "type": "if",
      "id": "branchCheck",
      "key": "trustedUmi",
      "equals": true,
      "then": "trustedLine",
      "else": "neutralLine"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "id": "trustedLine",
      "speaker": "rin",
      "text": "她的语气明显放松了。这个状态会保留到下一幕，你可以继续写不同的后续台词。",
      "voice": "/assets/audio/rin/prologue-002.ogg"
    },
    {
      "type": "jump",
      "target": "ending"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "id": "neutralLine",
      "speaker": "rin",
      "text": "她还保持着距离。不过没关系，分支和条件跳转已经能正常进入下一幕了。",
      "voice": "/assets/audio/rin/prologue-003.ogg"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "id": "ending",
      "speaker": "umi",
      "text": "序幕到这里结束。接下来会自动进入新场景，背景和立绘都会重新布置。",
      "voice": "/assets/audio/umi/prologue-005.ogg"
    },
    {
      "type": "end"
    }
  ]
}
